{"seq":2,"slug":"component-model","title":"组件模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/wasi-and-beyond/component-model","wordCount":885,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"组件模型\">组件模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>组件模型是 WASM 的<strong>下一代架构</strong>，目标是让不同语言编译出的模块无需 FFI 或 IPC 就能直接互操作。它做对了两件关键的事：其一，用 <strong>WIT（接口定义语言）<strong>描述契约，提供 <code>record</code>/<code>variant</code>/<code>result</code>/<code>list</code> 等高级类型，可精确映射到各语言原生类型；其二，规定每个组件拥有</strong>独立线性内存</strong>，组件间的数据交换交由运行时负责，从结构上消除了共享内存的安全风险。配合 <code>wasm-tools compose</code>、<code>cargo-component</code> 等工具，Rust、Go、Python、JavaScript 的代码便能像乐高积木一样组合。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasm-组件模型概述\">WASM 组件模型概述</h2><p>WASM 组件模型（Component Model）是 WebAssembly 的下一代架构，旨在让不同语言编写的 WASM 模块像乐高积木一样组合在一起。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 当前 Core WASM&#10;        MOD_A[&quot;模块 A (Rust)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;只能交换 i32/f64&quot;| MOD_B[&quot;模块 B (C++)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Component Model&#10;        COMP_A[&quot;组件 A (Rust)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;交换 string/record/list&quot;| COMP_B[&quot;组件 B (Python)&quot;]&#10;        COMP_A --&gt;|&quot;WIT 接口定义&quot;| COMP_C[&quot;组件 C (Go)&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 当前 Core WASM\n        MOD_A[\"模块 A (Rust)\"] --&gt;|\"只能交换 i32/f64\"| MOD_B[\"模块 B (C++)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Component Model\n        COMP_A[\"组件 A (Rust)\"] --&gt;|\"交换 string/record/list\"| COMP_B[\"组件 B (Python)\"]\n        COMP_A --&gt;|\"WIT 接口定义\"| COMP_C[\"组件 C (Go)\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Core WASM Module</th>\n<th>WASM Component</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型系统</td>\n<td>仅数值类型</td>\n<td>丰富高级类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互操作</td>\n<td>需要胶水代码</td>\n<td>直接接口匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合方式</td>\n<td>手动链接</td>\n<td>声明式组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口定义</td>\n<td>无标准</td>\n<td>WIT 接口语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存模型</td>\n<td>共享线性内存</td>\n<td>独立内存（按需共享）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态兼容</td>\n<td>所有引擎支持</td>\n<td>新引擎逐步支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 使用 wit-bindgen 生成绑定&#10;// wit/world.wit:&#10;// package example:calculator;&#10;// world calculator {&#10;//   export add: func(a: s32, b: s32) -&gt; s32;&#10;//   export multiply: func(a: s32, b: s32) -&gt; s32;&#10;// }&#10;&#10;wit_bindgen::generate!({&#10;    world: &quot;calculator&quot;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;struct MyCalculator;&#10;&#10;impl Guest for MyCalculator {&#10;    fn add(a: i32, b: i32) -&gt; i32 {&#10;        a + b&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn multiply(a: i32, b: i32) -&gt; i32 {&#10;        a * b&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;export!(MyCalculator);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 wit-bindgen 生成绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// wit/world.wit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// package example:calculator;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// world calculator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//   export add: func(a: s32, b: s32) -> s32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//   export multiply: func(a: s32, b: s32) -> s32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wit_bindgen::generate!({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    world: \"calculator\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct MyCalculator;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Guest for MyCalculator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn add(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        a + b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn multiply(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        a * b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export!(MyCalculator);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 组件模型的核心创新是<strong>独立内存</strong>——每个组件拥有自己的线性内存，组件间通过接口类型传递数据，由运行时负责数据的拷贝/转换。这消除了共享内存带来的安全风险。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wit-接口定义语言\">WIT 接口定义语言</h2><p>WIT（WASM Interface Types）是组件模型的接口定义语言，类似于 Protocol Buffers 或 IDL。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wit\" data-code=\"package my-org:image-processing@0.1.0;&#10;&#10;interface types {&#10;    record pixel {&#10;        r: u8,&#10;        g: u8,&#10;        b: u8,&#10;        a: u8,&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    record image {&#10;        width: u32,&#10;        height: u32,&#10;        pixels: list&lt;pixel&gt;,&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    enum format {&#10;        png,&#10;        jpeg,&#10;        webp,&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    variant error {&#10;        invalid-format(string),&#10;        decode-failed(string),&#10;        out-of-memory,&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface processor {&#10;    use types.{image, format, error};&#10;&#10;    resize: func(img: image, width: u32, height: u32) -&gt; result&lt;image, error&gt;;&#10;    convert: func(img: image, fmt: format) -&gt; result&lt;list&lt;u8&gt;, error&gt;;&#10;    blur: func(img: image, radius: f32) -&gt; result&lt;image, error&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;world image-editor {&#10;    import wasi:filesystem/types@0.2.0;&#10;    export processor;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package my-org:image-processing@0.1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface types {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    record pixel {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        r: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        g: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        b: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        a: u8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    record image {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        width: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        height: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pixels: list&#x3C;pixel>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    enum format {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        png,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        jpeg,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        webp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    variant error {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        invalid-format(string),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        decode-failed(string),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        out-of-memory,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface processor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use types.{image, format, error};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    resize: func(img: image, width: u32, height: u32) -> result&#x3C;image, error>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    convert: func(img: image, fmt: format) -> result&#x3C;list&#x3C;u8>, error>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    blur: func(img: image, radius: f32) -> result&#x3C;image, error>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>world image-editor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    import wasi:filesystem/types@0.2.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    export processor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WIT 类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>映射到 Rust</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td>布尔值</td>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>u8</code>-<code>u64</code></td>\n<td>无符号整数</td>\n<td><code>u8</code>-<code>u64</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>s8</code>-<code>s64</code></td>\n<td>有符号整数</td>\n<td><code>i8</code>-<code>i64</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>f32</code>/<code>f64</code></td>\n<td>浮点数</td>\n<td><code>f32</code>/<code>f64</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>string</code></td>\n<td>UTF-8 字符串</td>\n<td><code>String</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>list&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>列表</td>\n<td><code>Vec&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>option&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>可选值</td>\n<td><code>Option&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>result&lt;T, E&gt;</code></td>\n<td>结果类型</td>\n<td><code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>record</code></td>\n<td>命名字段结构</td>\n<td><code>struct</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>variant</code></td>\n<td>标签联合</td>\n<td><code>enum</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>enum</code></td>\n<td>简单枚举</td>\n<td><code>enum</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>flags</code></td>\n<td>位标志</td>\n<td><code>bitflags!</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tuple&lt;T...&gt;</code></td>\n<td>元组</td>\n<td><code>(T, ...)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    WIT[&quot;WIT 定义&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;wit-bindgen&quot;| RUST[&quot;Rust 绑定&quot;]&#10;    WIT --&gt;|&quot;wit-bindgen&quot;| JS_BIND[&quot;JavaScript 绑定&quot;]&#10;    WIT --&gt;|&quot;wit-bindgen&quot;| GO[&quot;Go 绑定&quot;]&#10;    WIT --&gt;|&quot;wit-bindgen&quot;| PYTHON[&quot;Python 绑定&quot;]&#10;    RUST --&gt; COMP1[&quot;Rust 组件&quot;]&#10;    JS_BIND --&gt; COMP2[&quot;JS 组件&quot;]&#10;    GO --&gt; COMP3[&quot;Go 组件&quot;]&#10;    COMP1 --&gt;|&quot;组合&quot;| APP[&quot;应用&quot;]&#10;    COMP2 --&gt; APP&#10;    COMP3 --&gt; APP\">graph TD\n    WIT[\"WIT 定义\"] --&gt;|\"wit-bindgen\"| RUST[\"Rust 绑定\"]\n    WIT --&gt;|\"wit-bindgen\"| JS_BIND[\"JavaScript 绑定\"]\n    WIT --&gt;|\"wit-bindgen\"| GO[\"Go 绑定\"]\n    WIT --&gt;|\"wit-bindgen\"| PYTHON[\"Python 绑定\"]\n    RUST --&gt; COMP1[\"Rust 组件\"]\n    JS_BIND --&gt; COMP2[\"JS 组件\"]\n    GO --&gt; COMP3[\"Go 组件\"]\n    COMP1 --&gt;|\"组合\"| APP[\"应用\"]\n    COMP2 --&gt; APP\n    COMP3 --&gt; APP</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WIT 的 <code>package</code> 声明使用类似 URL 的命名空间（如 <code>my-org:image-processing@0.1.0</code>），支持版本控制。发布 WIT 接口包类似于发布 npm 包或 Protobuf 定义。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"组件可组合性\">组件可组合性</h2><p>组件模型的核心价值在于<strong>声明式组合</strong>——将多个独立组件通过接口匹配连接成完整应用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 wasm-tools 组合组件&#10;wasm-tools compose \\&#10;  --config compose.yaml \\&#10;  main.wasm \\&#10;  -o composed.wasm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 wasm-tools 组合组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-tools</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  main.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> composed.wasm</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# compose.yaml&#10;instantiations:&#10;  image-lib:&#10;    source: image-processor.wasm&#10;  crypto-lib:&#10;    source: crypto-utils.wasm&#10;  main:&#10;    source: app-logic.wasm&#10;    arguments:&#10;      processor: image-lib&#10;      crypto: crypto-lib\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># compose.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">instantiations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  image-lib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">image-processor.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  crypto-lib</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">crypto-utils.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app-logic.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    arguments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">image-lib</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      crypto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">crypto-lib</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 组件 A&#10;        A_EXPORT[&quot;导出: processor&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 组件 B&#10;        B_IMPORT[&quot;导入: processor&quot;]&#10;        B_EXPORT[&quot;导出: app&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 组件 C&#10;        C_EXPORT[&quot;导出: crypto&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A_EXPORT --&gt;|&quot;接口匹配&quot;| B_IMPORT&#10;    C_EXPORT --&gt;|&quot;接口匹配&quot;| B_IMPORT2[&quot;导入: crypto&quot;]&#10;    B_EXPORT --&gt; RUNTIME[&quot;WASI 运行时&quot;]\">graph LR\n    subgraph 组件 A\n        A_EXPORT[\"导出: processor\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 组件 B\n        B_IMPORT[\"导入: processor\"]\n        B_EXPORT[\"导出: app\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 组件 C\n        C_EXPORT[\"导出: crypto\"]\n    end\n    A_EXPORT --&gt;|\"接口匹配\"| B_IMPORT\n    C_EXPORT --&gt;|\"接口匹配\"| B_IMPORT2[\"导入: crypto\"]\n    B_EXPORT --&gt; RUNTIME[\"WASI 运行时\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>wasm-tools compose</code></td>\n<td>静态组合组件</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wac</code></td>\n<td>WASM 组合语言</td>\n<td>开发中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cargo-component</code></td>\n<td>Rust 组件构建工具</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>componentize-py</code></td>\n<td>Python → 组件</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>componentize-js</code></td>\n<td>JavaScript → 组件</td>\n<td>开发中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"语言无关接口\">语言无关接口</h2><p>组件模型最革命性的特性是让不同编程语言的代码通过 WIT 接口直接互操作，无需 FFI 或 IPC。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Rust 组件&#10;        RUST_CODE[&quot;Rust 实现&lt;br/&gt;图像处理算法&quot;]&#10;        RUST_CODE --&gt; RUST_WIT[&quot;符合 WIT 接口&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Python 组件&#10;        PY_CODE[&quot;Python 实现&lt;br/&gt;ML 推理&quot;]&#10;        PY_CODE --&gt; PY_WIT[&quot;符合 WIT 接口&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph JavaScript 组件&#10;        JS_CODE[&quot;JS 实现&lt;br/&gt;业务逻辑&quot;]&#10;        JS_CODE --&gt; JS_WIT[&quot;符合 WIT 接口&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    RUST_WIT --&gt; COMPOSED[&quot;组合后的应用&quot;]&#10;    PY_WIT --&gt; COMPOSED&#10;    JS_WIT --&gt; COMPOSED&#10;    COMPOSED --&gt; RUNTIME[&quot;统一运行时&quot;]\">graph TD\n    subgraph Rust 组件\n        RUST_CODE[\"Rust 实现&lt;br/&gt;图像处理算法\"]\n        RUST_CODE --&gt; RUST_WIT[\"符合 WIT 接口\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Python 组件\n        PY_CODE[\"Python 实现&lt;br/&gt;ML 推理\"]\n        PY_CODE --&gt; PY_WIT[\"符合 WIT 接口\"]\n    end\n    subgraph JavaScript 组件\n        JS_CODE[\"JS 实现&lt;br/&gt;业务逻辑\"]\n        JS_CODE --&gt; JS_WIT[\"符合 WIT 接口\"]\n    end\n    RUST_WIT --&gt; COMPOSED[\"组合后的应用\"]\n    PY_WIT --&gt; COMPOSED\n    JS_WIT --&gt; COMPOSED\n    COMPOSED --&gt; RUNTIME[\"统一运行时\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传统互操作方式</th>\n<th>组件模型方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>C FFI 函数</td>\n<td>WIT 接口定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动类型转换</td>\n<td>自动类型映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享内存管理</td>\n<td>运行时自动拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台特定</td>\n<td>完全可移植</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全风险高</td>\n<td>沙箱隔离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// cargo-component 创建组件&#10;// Cargo.toml&#10;// [package.metadata.component]&#10;// package = &quot;my-org:image-lib&quot;&#10;//&#10;// [package.metadata.component.target]&#10;// world = &quot;image-editor&quot;&#10;&#10;wit_bindgen::generate!({&#10;    world: &quot;image-editor&quot;,&#10;    exports: {&#10;        &quot;my-org:image-processing/processor&quot;: ImageProcessor,&#10;    },&#10;});&#10;&#10;struct ImageProcessor;&#10;&#10;impl exports::my_org::image_processing::processor::Guest for ImageProcessor {&#10;    fn resize(img: Image, width: u32, height: u32) -&gt; Result&lt;Image, Error&gt; {&#10;        Ok(img)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn blur(img: Image, radius: f32) -&gt; Result&lt;Image, Error&gt; {&#10;        Ok(img)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fn convert(img: Image, fmt: Format) -&gt; Result&lt;Vec&lt;u8&gt;, Error&gt; {&#10;        Ok(vec![])&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// cargo-component 创建组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [package.metadata.component]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// package = \"my-org:image-lib\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// [package.metadata.component.target]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// world = \"image-editor\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wit_bindgen::generate!({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    world: \"image-editor\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    exports: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"my-org:image-processing/processor\": ImageProcessor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct ImageProcessor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl exports::my_org::image_processing::processor::Guest for ImageProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn resize(img: Image, width: u32, height: u32) -> Result&#x3C;Image, Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(img)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn blur(img: Image, radius: f32) -> Result&#x3C;Image, Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(img)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn convert(img: Image, fmt: Format) -> Result&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;u8>, Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(vec![])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 组件模型的&quot;语言无关&quot;并非只是理论——Fermyon Spin 框架已经支持在同一个应用中混合使用 Rust、Go、Python 和 JavaScript 组件，每个组件处理不同的 HTTP 路由。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((组件模型))&#10;    概述&#10;      下一代架构&#10;      独立内存模型&#10;      声明式组合&#10;    WIT 语言&#10;      接口定义&#10;      丰富类型系统&#10;      多语言绑定生成&#10;    可组合性&#10;      静态组合&#10;      接口匹配&#10;      工具链支持&#10;    语言无关&#10;      Rust/Go/Python/JS&#10;      WIT 统一接口&#10;      无需 FFI/IPC\">mindmap\n  root((组件模型))\n    概述\n      下一代架构\n      独立内存模型\n      声明式组合\n    WIT 语言\n      接口定义\n      丰富类型系统\n      多语言绑定生成\n    可组合性\n      静态组合\n      接口匹配\n      工具链支持\n    语言无关\n      Rust/Go/Python/JS\n      WIT 统一接口\n      无需 FFI/IPC</pre><ul>\n<li>组件模型是 WASM 的下一代架构，让不同语言的模块通过<strong>WIT 接口定义</strong>直接互操作。</li>\n<li>每个组件拥有<strong>独立的线性内存</strong>，组件间数据交换由运行时负责，消除共享内存安全风险。</li>\n<li>WIT 提供了 <code>record</code>、<code>variant</code>、<code>result</code>、<code>list</code> 等<strong>丰富的高级类型</strong>，直接映射到各语言原生类型。</li>\n<li><code>wasm-tools compose</code> 和 <code>cargo-component</code> 等工具支持<strong>声明式组件组合</strong>。</li>\n<li>组件模型让 Rust、Go、Python、JavaScript 的代码像<strong>乐高积木</strong>一样组合，无需 FFI 或 IPC。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"组件模型","id":"组件模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WASM 组件模型概述","id":"wasm-组件模型概述"},{"level":2,"text":"WIT 接口定义语言","id":"wit-接口定义语言"},{"level":2,"text":"组件可组合性","id":"组件可组合性"},{"level":2,"text":"语言无关接口","id":"语言无关接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WASI 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/wasi-and-beyond/wasi-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"服务端 WASM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/wasi-and-beyond/server-side-wasm"}}